.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK ATTACHMENT DOWNLOAD"
.SH NAME
hamstik work attachment download \- Download an attachment to a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work attachment download [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download an attachment to a file
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.TP
.I ATTACHMENT_ID
Attachment id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -o, --output
Output path (defaults to the attachment's file name in the current directory)
